    {
      "id": "c9b1a718-d48d-4c17-aca8-35c5e7df3332",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1248,
        -208
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 736,
        "content": "## Automated AI Email Classification & labelling\n### How it works\n\n1. The workflow triggers upon receiving a new email in Gmail and verifies against Google Sheets if it has already been processed.\n2. An AI agent classifies and analyzes the email content using Google Gemini and a structured schema.\n3. The analysis results are structured, applied as labels in Gmail, and logged into Google Sheets.\n4. If the email requires a reply, an AI agent drafts a response and creates a draft message in Gmail.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- - [ ] Connect your Gmail account for triggering and managing labels/drafts.\n- - [ ] Connect your Google Sheets account for tracking processed emails and logging triage.\n- - [ ] Configure your Google Gemini API credentials for the AI agent nodes.\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can modify the AI prompt in the classification node to detect different categories or specific sentiment metrics relevant to your business."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "97b04aba-38df-47d9-bfb9-870cf0baa42b",
